<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A7.SS2" title="In Appendix G Theoretical Analysis ‣ Language Modeling with Learned Meta-Tokens" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G.2 </span>Proof of Theorem 5.1</span></a></li>
